{"id":2126,"level":79,"name":"Майстерня зв’язок (2)","group":"Опануй зв’язку","format":27,"description":"<p><span style='font-weight: 400;'>It is time for a pin party again. In the pin party, you use an existing pin. This pin prevents an enemy piece from adequately performing its defensive tasks. Take advantage of this by capturing material.</span></p>  <p></p>  <p><b>What do you have to do?</b></p>  <p><span style='font-weight: 400;'>Win material by using a pin. The pin prevents an enemy piece from properly performing its defensive tasks.</span></p>","assignment":"","stickerID":91,"examples":[{"fen":"4r2k/pp3rp1/2p5/4Bp2/3PbRpP/2P5/P1P3P1/5RK1 w - - 0 28","pgn":"28. Rxe4 * ","text":"<p>слон на e4 здається добре захищеним, але ніщо не може бути дальшим від істини. Білі грають<strong> 1.Rxe4!</strong>, а чорні не можуть відбити через вертикальну зв’язку на вертикалі f.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"2r2rk1/1Q3p1p/p3p1p1/1b6/3P1q2/2P1R3/5PPP/1BR3K1 b - - 0 27","pgn":"27... Qxd4 28. cxd4 Rxc1+ * ","text":"<p>У білих проблеми на задній шерензі, і чорні користуються перевагою, <strong>27...Qxd4! </strong>Повторне взяття тепер призводить до швидкого мату.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"r1b1r1k1/pp4bp/1q2p1p1/4PpP1/3Pp2P/2P5/PP2B3/R1B1QRK1 b - - 0 19","pgn":"19... Bxe5 {[%csl Gb6,Rd4,Ge5,Rg1][%cal Gb6g1,Rd4e5]} * ","text":"","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":78266,"fen":"r4rk1/1ppbqppp/2np2n1/p7/2PN4/P1R1P1B1/1P2BPPP/1Q3RK1 b - - 0 15","pgn":"{[%csl Re2,Re3][%evp 0,3,-316,-340,-309,-333]} {Q=1} 15... Nxd4 16. exd4 {Q=2} Qxe2 * ","format":27,"texts":["Зв’язані пішаки погано захищаються.","Час заробляти!"],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":78274,"fen":"r7/1p2k2p/1r3pp1/2p1p3/2N5/1B2P1P1/P4P1P/K2R4 b - - 0 28","pgn":"{[%csl Ra1,Ra2][%evp 0,1,-399,-394]} {Q=1} 28... Rxb3 * ","format":27,"texts":["Зв’язані пішаки погано захищаються."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":80566,"fen":"3r4/pq2k2p/1p3pp1/2n1p3/8/1Q3NP1/PP2PP1P/2R3K1 w - - 0 29","pgn":"{[%csl Rb6]} 29. Rxc5